`` runs the job in a separate thread with its own event loop, but\nthe ``new_log_evt`` waiters live in the daemon loop. ``asyncio.Event.set()`` is\nnot thread-safe, so without hopping back onto the daemon loop the terminal DONE\nnotification is lost and ``ws_poll_info`` hangs forever (the desktop app's\n&quot;finalizing&quot; step never completes and the connection eventually drops).\n``from_threadpool`` mimics sync routes (``/update/start``), which call\n``run_command`` from FastAPI's threadpool, with no running loop.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"3e013b1470c7e04ff1a1aa806502a4f7","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"b4f0245d88a78e19974ffa7d21e7b53a","type":"before","name":"tmp_path_factory","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"3b28726bd817685e173b89a92a12ae8c","type":"before","name":"monkeypatch","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"80738a6fcb3821bf1f8cdbc62dee1058","type":"before","name":"_isolated_hf_credentials","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"52bb7f08970531d7f1f7f3bc4bc0fa88","type":"before","name":"_no_telemetry","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"c56a5cdafb3c66d936367e634c4113f9","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"ad46904be88cfc288d4164ec70f659a9","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"54cf00fc0cb201bde8ec762593f5daeb","type":"after","name":"monkeypatch::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[{"id":"8e99aaf2c887a325da8378ebb36fc5a3","name":"test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread[False]","fullName":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register#test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread","environment":"default","status":"passed","retries":[],"start":1794999786241,"stop":1794999786344,"duration":103,"labels":[{"name":"tag","value":